}
Maydon	Izoh
gift_id	Sovg'a identifikatori — xaridda shu yuboriladi
emoji_id	Telegram custom emoji id (animatsion ikonka)
price_uzs	Siz to'laydigan yakuniy narx (ustama qo'shilgan)
Buyurtmalar tarixi
GET
/orders
?limit=20
Oxirgi buyurtmalaringiz. limit — 1 dan 100 gacha (standart 20).

Nusxa
curl 'https://69544e6345d5c.xvest5.ru/ApilarimBot/api/v2/orders?limit=5' -H 'X-API-Key: SIZNING_KALITINGIZ'
Bitta buyurtmani ID bo'yicha olish:

Nusxa
curl 'https://69544e6345d5c.xvest5.ru/ApilarimBot/api/v2/order/260812143022-a1b2c3' -H 'X-API-Key: SIZNING_KALITINGIZ'
status	Ma'nosi
success	Bajarildi, pul yechildi
failed	Bajarilmadi — pul balansga qaytarilgan
processing	Jarayonda (odatda bir necha soniya)
